UpdateBudget/Binaries/
UpdateBudget/Intermediate/
UpdateBudget/Saved/
UpdateBudget/DerivedDataCache/
UpdateBudget/Build/
UpdateBudget/Plugins/*/Binaries/
UpdateBudget/Plugins/*/Intermediate/
UpdateBudget/.vs/
UpdateBudget/*.sln
UpdateBudget/*.slnx
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo

# Python
__pycache__/

# Packaged builds stay out of git.
Build/

# Benchmarks: raw captures, run reports and logs stay local (a full matrix is about 1 GB; UE logs also hold
# machine-specific paths). Manifests and Summaries/ are committed; cited raw batches go to GitHub Releases.
Benchmarks/Raw/*
!Benchmarks/Raw/*_manifest.json
Benchmarks/*_console.txt

